{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/journal/layout,_N_T_/journal/page,_N_T_/journal"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--lEumuof_GfEtWVTZSjWDG--><html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark __variable_17031a __variable_c2c3d1 __variable_967564\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/0a86735c6520d94f-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/36ef2834916397d3-s.p.ttf\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/ttf\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/49d2f31d75dd11b6-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/91a8d5250c2f2545-s.p.ttf\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/ttf\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-f47c4580da509d27.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/b39499bc-5a3d39d43e1fe6cb.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/9311-340498c9694e41f2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-1f3f35e1ff696209.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1859-70651bf18819b8bd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/journal/page-fe3350074504a8a8.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Journal · Undate</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Undate Journal, essays on intentional dating, attachment, and the quiet work of finding a partner.\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Undate\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Intentional matchmaking for the people who know what they want.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Undate\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Intentional matchmaking for the people who know what they want.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/undate-logo.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-ink-900 text-cream-50 font-sans antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16\"><a class=\"text-sm text-cream-50/60 hover:text-cream-50\" href=\"/\">← Undate</a><header class=\"mt-10\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-700\">The Undate Journal</p><h1 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-5xl tracking-tight\">On intentional dating.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream-50/75\">Essays from the people building Undate and from a small group of writers, therapists, and researchers we trust. We publish slowly. We publish when we have something to say.</p></header><section class=\"mt-16 space-y-8 border-t border-cream-50/10 pt-12\"><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream-50/40\"><time dateTime=\"2026-05-12\">12 May 2026</time><span>·</span><span>6 min</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-gold-500\"><span class=\"cursor-pointer\">Why fewer, not more.</span></h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/70\">The big apps optimise for endless choice. We optimise, deliberately, for a small and considered community. Here is why that is the entire point.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-cream-50/40\">Full essay coming soon.</p></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream-50/40\"><time dateTime=\"2026-05-05\">5 May 2026</time><span>·</span><span>9 min</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-gold-500\"><span class=\"cursor-pointer\">The anxious-avoidant trap.</span></h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/70\">One of the most-cited findings in attachment research is that anxious-avoidant pairings are the most likely to dissolve. Why dating apps quietly amplify them.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-cream-50/40\">Full essay coming soon.</p></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream-50/40\"><time dateTime=\"2026-04-21\">21 Apr 2026</time><span>·</span><span>7 min</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-gold-500\"><span class=\"cursor-pointer\">What the algorithm cannot do.</span></h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/70\">The research is humbling: what people say they want before meeting barely predicts how a relationship turns out. So why are we still building rankers?</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-cream-50/40\">Full essay coming soon.</p></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream-50/40\"><time dateTime=\"2026-04-07\">7 Apr 2026</time><span>·</span><span>11 min</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-gold-500\"><span class=\"cursor-pointer\">A defence of the curator.</span></h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/70\">The human matchmaker has quietly been the most loved dating product for decades. What thoughtful software can do to help, rather than replace, them.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-cream-50/40\">Full essay coming soon.</p></article></section><footer class=\"mt-24 rounded-lg border border-cream-50/10 p-6 text-sm text-cream-50/60\"><p>Want these in your inbox? Undate members receive the Journal monthly. Non-members can request access via the waitlist, <a class=\"text-gold-700 hover:text-gold-500\" href=\"/waitlist\">join here</a>.</p></footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-f47c4580da509d27.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9278,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[9844,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[1859,[\\\"1859\\\",\\\"static/chunks/1859-70651bf18819b8bd.js\\\",\\\"2822\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/journal/page-fe3350074504a8a8.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\nd:I[1030,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/0a86735c6520d94f-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/36ef2834916397d3-s.p.ttf\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/ttf\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/49d2f31d75dd11b6-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/91a8d5250c2f2545-s.p.ttf\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/ttf\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"lEumuof_GfEtWVTZSjWDG\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"journal\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"journal\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"dark __variable_17031a __variable_c2c3d1 __variable_96756